---
// AiShowcaseBanner.astro - High-tech AI Ecosystem Showcase featuring Claude Mascot, Gemini, ChatGPT & SAP Joule
---

<section class="py-14 px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 relative z-10">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto">
    
    <!-- Section Header Badge -->
    <div class="text-center space-y-3 mb-10">
      <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-4 py-1.5 rounded-full glass-panel border border-purple-500/40 text-purple-300 text-xs font-mono tracking-widest uppercase shadow-neon-purple/20">
        <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-purple-400 animate-pulse"></span>
        <span>AI Engine & Autonomous Agents Ecosystem</span>
      </div>
      <h2 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl md:text-4xl font-black font-display text-white tracking-tight">
        Potenciado por la Vanguardia en <span class="text-transparent bg-clip-text bg-gradient-to-r from-purple-400 via-pink-400 to-cyan-400">Inteligencia Artificial</span>
      </h2>
      <p class="text-sm sm:text-base text-slate-200 max-w-2xl mx-auto font-normal leading-relaxed">
        No utilizo la IA como un simple chatbot; implemento arquitecturas de agentes autónomos, integración con Model Context Protocol (MCP) y flujos generativos aplicados a procesos ERP reales.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- 4 AI Powerhouse Cards Grid -->
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 xl:grid-cols-4 gap-5 sm:gap-6">
      
      <!-- 1. ANTHROPIC CLAUDE CARD (With Mascot!) -->
      <div class="glass-panel glass-panel-hover rounded-3xl p-5 sm:p-6 xl:p-7 border border-amber-500/30 hover:border-amber-400/80 relative overflow-hidden group flex flex-col justify-between">
        <div class="space-y-4">
          <div class="flex items-start justify-between">
            <!-- Mascot / Icon -->
            <div class="w-14 h-14 rounded-2xl bg-gradient-to-br from-amber-500/25 to-orange-600/25 border border-amber-500/50 p-2 flex items-center justify-center group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform duration-300 shadow-neon-gold/30">
              <svg class="w-10 h-10" viewBox="0 0 100 100" fill="none">
                <rect x="20" y="24" width="60" height="56" rx="28" fill="#D97706" />
                <rect x="23" y="27" width="54" height="50" rx="25" fill="#F59E0B" />
                <rect x="28" y="34" width="44" height="34" rx="14" fill="#18181B" />
                <circle cx="42" cy="48" r="4.5" fill="#FFFFFF" class="group-hover:scale-125 transition-transform" />
                <circle cx="58" cy="48" r="4.5" fill="#FFFFFF" class="group-hover:scale-125 transition-transform" />
                <path d="M44 56 Q50 62 56 56" stroke="#FFFFFF" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round" fill="none" />
                <circle cx="50" cy="16" r="4" fill="#FBBF24" />
                <line x1="50" y1="20" x2="50" y2="24" stroke="#FBBF24" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round" />
                <circle cx="16" cy="52" r="5" fill="#D97706" />
                <circle cx="84" cy="52" r="5" fill="#D97706" />
              </svg>
            </div>
            <span class="px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-xs font-mono font-bold bg-amber-500/20 text-amber-300 border border-amber-500/40">
              Claude 3.7 / MCP
            </span>
          </div>

          <h3 class="text-lg sm:text-xl font-extrabold text-white font-display flex items-center gap-1.5">
            <span>Anthropic Claude</span>
          </h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-slate-200 leading-relaxed font-normal">
            Diseño de <strong class="text-amber-300 font-bold">Agentes Autónomos</strong> mediante Model Context Protocol (MCP) y Claude Code. Generación de lógica técnica y refactorización Clean Core.
          </p>
        </div>
        
        <div class="mt-5 pt-4 border-t border-white/10 flex flex-wrap gap-2">
          <span class="text-xs font-mono px-2.5 py-1 rounded-md bg-amber-950/50 text-amber-200 border border-amber-800/50 font-semibold">MCP Protocol</span>
          <span class="text-xs font-mono px-2.5 py-1 rounded-md bg-amber-950/50 text-amber-200 border border-amber-800/50 font-semibold">Tool Calling</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- 2. GOOGLE GEMINI CARD -->
      <div class="glass-panel glass-panel-hover rounded-3xl p-5 sm:p-6 xl:p-7 border border-blue-500/30 hover:border-blue-400/80 relative overflow-hidden group flex flex-col justify-between">
        <div class="space-y-4">
          <div class="flex items-start justify-between">
            <div class="w-14 h-14 rounded-2xl bg-gradient-to-br from-blue-500/25 via-indigo-600/25 to-purple-600/25 border border-blue-500/50 p-2.5 flex items-center justify-center group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform duration-300 shadow-neon-cyan/30">
              <svg class="w-9 h-9" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none">
                <path d="M12 2C12 7.52 7.52 12 2 12C7.52 12 12 16.48 12 22C12 16.48 16.48 12 22 12C16.48 12 12 7.52 12 2Z" fill="url(#gemini-grad-2)" />
                <defs>
                  <linearGradient id="gemini-grad-2" x1="2" y1="2" x2="22" y2="22" gradientUnits="userSpaceOnUse">
                    <stop stop-color="#4285F4" />
                    <stop offset="0.5" stop-color="#9B72CB" />
                    <stop offset="1" stop-color="#D96570" />
                  </linearGradient>
                </defs>
              </svg>
            </div>
            <span class="px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-xs font-mono font-bold bg-blue-500/20 text-blue-300 border border-blue-500/40">
              Google Skills
            </span>
          </div>

          <h3 class="text-lg sm:text-xl font-extrabold text-white font-display">
            Google Gemini
          </h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-slate-200 leading-relaxed font-normal">
            Modelos multimodales de <strong class="text-blue-300 font-bold">contexto masivo</strong> para análisis de documentación funcional, especificaciones CEDA y arquitecturas en GCP.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="mt-5 pt-4 border-t border-white/10 flex flex-wrap gap-2">
          <span class="text-xs font-mono px-2.5 py-1 rounded-md bg-blue-950/50 text-blue-200 border border-blue-800/50 font-semibold">Multimodal</span>
          <span class="text-xs font-mono px-2.5 py-1 rounded-md bg-blue-950/50 text-blue-200 border border-blue-800/50 font-semibold">GCP Skills</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- 3. OPENAI CHATGPT CARD -->
      <div class="glass-panel glass-panel-hover rounded-3xl p-5 sm:p-6 xl:p-7 border border-emerald-500/30 hover:border-emerald-400/80 relative overflow-hidden group flex flex-col justify-between">
        <div class="space-y-4">
          <div class="flex items-start justify-between">
            <div class="w-14 h-14 rounded-2xl bg-gradient-to-br from-emerald-500/25 to-teal-600/25 border border-emerald-500/50 p-2.5 flex items-center justify-center group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform duration-300 shadow-emerald-500/30">
              <svg class="w-8 h-8 text-emerald-400" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor">
                <path d="M22.2819 9.8211a5.9847 5.9847 0 0 0-.5157-4.9108 6.0462 6.0462 0 0 0-6.5098-2.9A6.0651 6.0651 0 0 0 4.9807 4.1818a5.9847 5.9847 0 0 0-3.9977 2.9 6.0462 6.0462 0 0 0 .7427 7.0966 5.98 5.98 0 0 0 .511 4.9107 6.051 6.051 0 0 0 6.5146 2.9001A5.9847 5.9847 0 0 0 13.2599 24a6.0557 6.0557 0 0 0 5.7718-4.2058 5.9894 5.9894 0 0 0 3.9977-2.9001 6.0557 6.0557 0 0 0-.7475-7.0729zm-9.022 12.6081a4.4755 4.4755 0 0 1-2.8764-1.0408l.1419-.0804 4.7783-2.7582a.7948.7948 0 0 0 .3927-.6813v-6.7369l2.02 1.1686a.071.071 0 0 1 .038.052v5.5826a4.504 4.504 0 0 1-4.4945 4.4944zm-9.6607-4.1254a4.4708 4.4708 0 0 1-.5346-3.0137l.142.0852 4.783 2.7582a.7712.7712 0 0 0 .7806 0l5.8428-3.3685v2.3324a.0804.0804 0 0 1-.0332.0615L9.74 19.9502a4.4992 4.4992 0 0 1-6.1408-1.6464zM2.3408 7.8956a4.485 4.485 0 0 1 2.3655-1.9728V11.6a.7664.7664 0 0 0 .3879.6765l5.8144 3.3543-2.0201 1.1685a.0757.0757 0 0 1-.071 0l-4.8303-2.7865A4.504 4.504 0 0 1 2.3408 7.8956zm16.0993 3.8558L12.5973 8.3829l2.0201-1.1685a.0757.0757 0 0 1 .071 0l4.8303 2.7913a4.4944 4.4944 0 0 1-.6765 8.1042v-5.6772a.79.79 0 0 0-.4021-.6813zm2.0107-3.0231l-.142-.0852-4.7735-2.7818a.7759.7759 0 0 0-.7854 0L9.409 9.2297V6.8974a.0662.0662 0 0 1 .0284-.0615l4.8303-2.7866a4.4992 4.4992 0 0 1 6.6802 4.6644zM8.3072 12.863l-2.02-1.1638a.0804.0804 0 0 1-.038-.0567V6.0742a4.4992 4.4992 0 0 1 7.3757-3.4537l-.142.0805L8.7046 5.4592a.7948.7948 0 0 0-.3927.6813l-.0047 6.7225zm1.093-1.0789L12 10.297l2.6045 1.5042v3.0185L12 16.324l-2.5998-1.5042v-3.0357z"/>
              </svg>
            </div>
            <span class="px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-xs font-mono font-bold bg-emerald-500/20 text-emerald-300 border border-emerald-500/40">
              Function Calling
            </span>
          </div>

          <h3 class="text-lg sm:text-xl font-extrabold text-white font-display">
            OpenAI ChatGPT
          </h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-slate-200 leading-relaxed font-normal">
            Especialización en <strong class="text-emerald-300 font-bold">Structured Outputs</strong>, generación de tests automatizados y orquestación de llamadas API a sistemas legados.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="mt-5 pt-4 border-t border-white/10 flex flex-wrap gap-2">
          <span class="text-xs font-mono px-2.5 py-1 rounded-md bg-emerald-950/50 text-emerald-200 border border-emerald-800/50 font-semibold">API Function</span>
          <span class="text-xs font-mono px-2.5 py-1 rounded-md bg-emerald-950/50 text-emerald-200 border border-emerald-800/50 font-semibold">Data Validation</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- 4. SAP JOULE CARD -->
      <div class="glass-panel glass-panel-hover rounded-3xl p-5 sm:p-6 xl:p-7 border border-cyan-500/30 hover:border-cyan-400/80 relative overflow-hidden group flex flex-col justify-between">
        <div class="space-y-4">
          <div class="flex items-start justify-between">
            <div class="w-14 h-14 rounded-2xl bg-gradient-to-br from-cyan-500/25 via-blue-600/25 to-amber-500/25 border border-cyan-500/50 p-2.5 flex items-center justify-center group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform duration-300 shadow-neon-cyan/30">
              <svg class="w-9 h-9 text-cyan-400" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none">
                <polygon points="12 2 15.09 8.26 22 9.27 17 14.14 18.18 21.02 12 17.77 5.82 21.02 7 14.14 2 9.27 8.91 8.26 12 2" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" fill="rgba(0, 243, 255, 0.25)" />
                <circle cx="12" cy="12" r="3.5" fill="#F0AB00" />
              </svg>
            </div>
            <span class="px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-xs font-mono font-bold bg-cyan-500/20 text-cyan-300 border border-cyan-500/40">
              SAP Clean Core
            </span>
          </div>

          <h3 class="text-lg sm:text-xl font-extrabold text-white font-display">
            SAP Joule & ERP AI
          </h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-slate-200 leading-relaxed font-normal">
            Capacitador oficial en <strong class="text-cyan-300 font-bold">SAP Joule</strong>, GROW & RISE with SAP. Optimización de compras, gestión de almacenes y análisis financiero directo en Fiori.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="mt-5 pt-4 border-t border-white/10 flex flex-wrap gap-2">
          <span class="text-xs font-mono px-2.5 py-1 rounded-md bg-cyan-950/50 text-cyan-200 border border-cyan-800/50 font-semibold">Clean Core</span>
          <span class="text-xs font-mono px-2.5 py-1 rounded-md bg-cyan-950/50 text-cyan-200 border border-cyan-800/50 font-semibold">S/4HANA Cloud</span>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>

  </div>
</section>
